    "text": "A convex lens of focal length <math><mn>20</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> produces images of the same magnification 2 when an object is kept at two distances <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> from the lens. The ratio of <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is:",
